OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after illegal
OL,4,Awarehouse rave
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested for
OL,7,Fcausing a public nuisance after an
OL,8,Funlicensed music event attended by
OL,9,Fabout 1,000 people kept residents awake
OL,10,Finto the morning.
OL,12,FAvon and Somerset Police said it
OL,13,Freceived multiple reports of very loud
OL,14,Fmusic coming from a disused warehouse
OL,15,Fat City Business Park in Lawrence Hill,
OL,16,FBristol, at midnight on Sunday.
OL,18,FThe force said as soon as enough police
OL,19,Fofficers were available, they managed
OL,20,Fto force entry into the building and
OL,21,Fseize equipment by 10:30 GMT.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
