OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested after illegal
OL,4,Awarehouse rave
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It was pretty brutal. None of us have
OL,7,Fslept all night," said Dean Buck, who
OL,8,Flives in a block of flats directly
OL,9,Fopposite the building.
